    pred:depends-on kb:llm-providers ;
    pred:description "Replace scattered provider selection and silent fallback branches with a provider-neutral ModelRoutePolicy and append-only ModelRouteDecision. The native TypeScript router chooses an eligible target and records why; existing provider adapters still make the calls. Switchyard may later be configured as an optional localhost adapter, not installed as required infrastructure." ;
