    pred:feature-id "F101.1" ;
    pred:depends-on kb:archive-foundation ;
    pred:description "Three autonomy tiers modelled on Claude Code's permission modes, default SUGGEST. suggest = pending facts only (today's behavior). auto-safe = Shelly applies reversible mechanical edits (exact-duplicate triples, type fills). auto-all = adds merges and prunes. EVERY automated edit writes an archive journal event carrying timestamp, actor=agent, and payload — which is exactly kb:auto-archive's existing scope-decision ('EDIT JOURNAL, not just aged-out facts... what makes revert possible at all'), so it builds on src/lib/rdf/archive.ts rather than inventing a second mechanism. Restore = merge a set from the archive graph back into the working graph (kb:archive-revert)." ;
