    pred:principle "CLEANING IS ITSELF DAMAGING. Dirty data is the stated fear, but an automated tidy-up that silently drops a fact the user needed is worse than the mess it removed. Therefore no destructive edit may be unreachable from the archive journal — autonomy is bounded by reversibility, not by confidence." ;
