    pred:description "Executable end-to-end scenarios that cross TWO OR MORE integrations, because that is where this product's value and its bugs both live. The worked example (Matt, 2026-07-31): 'Schedule an appointment with Chelsey at 3pm next Tuesday, and check Currents for new research before then and give me a summary' — one utterance spanning calendar WRITE (F99.2), the n8n Currents monitor, a reckoning over the graph, and spoken output. Each scenario is a story with ordered steps and assertions, in the shape docs-testing.ttl already uses." ;
