    pred:constraint "NEVER SYNTHESIZE PRECISION. A parser that returns plain text gets a verified text span and no page/bbox. Missing geometry is unknown, not page 1 at 0,0. If sourceHash no longer matches the retained revision, the anchor is stale and cannot be shown as currently verified until remapped or re-extracted." ;
