    pred:touches-file "src/lib/rdf/types.ts" ;
    pred:decided "STORAGE AND EXPORT. DocumentIR and anchor geometry live beside the reviewed source copy under the private sources boundary or an OPFS fallback; the graph stores compact anchor identity, source revision and excerpt provenance. Normal graph export may include those compact anchors. Raw PDFs/images and retained third-party source bodies remain excluded from published graph packages by construction." ;
    pred:part-of kb:source-reference-copy ;
    pred:decided "ANCHOR CONTRACT. EvidenceAnchor carries anchorId, sourceId, sourceHash, blockId, exact excerpt, normalized character start/end within the block and, when truly supplied, one-based page plus bbox x/y/width/height in 0..1 coordinates. Statement carries one or more evidenceAnchorIds and extractionRunId; shared anchors are stored once rather than duplicating geometry on every statement." ;
    pred:constraint "EXISTENCE AND FAITHFULNESS ARE DIFFERENT CHECKS. Exact excerpt/span containment and bbox bounds are deterministic. Whether the passage actually supports the proposed fact is semantic judgement and remains a critic/human signal; a real quote can still be irrelevant evidence." ;
    pred:remaining "DONE WHEN a rotated multi-page fixture yields stable anchors; selecting a proposed fact opens the correct retained page and highlights the correct region; text-only input degrades honestly to a span; changing the source revision invalidates rather than misplaces the anchor; and graph publication excludes the original document bytes." ;
    pred:description "Extend today's verified excerpt into an addressable EvidenceAnchor tied to the exact retained source revision. Text-only sources keep character spans; paged and visual documents can additionally retain page, region, reading order and normalized geometry so clicking a fact can reopen the evidence rather than merely show a quote." ;
    pred:relates-to kb:review-anchored-generation ;
    pred:touches-file "src/lib/rdf/source-cache.ts" ;
    pred:relates-to kb:reviewable-graph-patches ;
