kb:reference-repo-architecture
    pred:has-part kb:model-routing-ledger ;
    rdf:type <urn:kbase:type/Concept> ;
    pred:description "Architecture agreed 2026-08-16 after reviewing iai-pme, fenic, OntoCast, docTR, old-coder, Docling Graph and NVIDIA NeMo Switchyard. The useful convergence is typed and inspectable processing, source-addressable evidence, deterministic validation and routing, bounded local context and fresh verification records. None requires adopting the reference implementation wholesale." ;
