    rdfs:label "Browser fact-finding sessions (highlight, analyze, link)" ;
    pred:principle "Disconnected data is less valuable — but a FORCED link is worse than an orphan. If the content genuinely does not overlap the graph, relate it to nothing and say so. An invented edge is a lie the graph tells itself, and it is the same failure as the fabricated citation in kb:passage-grounding: it looks like knowledge and it is not." ;
    pred:has-status "planned" ;
    pred:depends-on kb:browser-extension ;
