kb:ttl-aware-ingest
    pred:relates-to kb:ingest-pipeline ;
    rdf:type <urn:kbase:type/Feature> ;
    pred:description "When Add-from-URL points at a Reckons.AI graph, import it DIRECTLY as pending facts with no LLM extraction. Detection: try a direct fetch and check content-type text/turtle, a .ttl extension, or an HTML <link rel=alternate type=text/turtle>; on hit, route the TTL through the existing importTurtleFull → pending statements (reuses the file/Drive import path). Falls back to the current firecrawl/jina + LLM flow when the URL is not a graph or is CORS-blocked. Cheaper, exact, and lossless vs. re-extracting prose the publisher already modelled." ;
