<urn:reckons:story/rm-step-7>
    <urn:reckons:story/content> "The next frontier: aligning knowledge across multiple graphs. Compare a production status graph against a roadmap graph to see gaps. Each suggested change clearly indicates which graph it targets. This turns Reckons.AI into a tool for tracking vision vs reality." ;
