kb:passage-grounding
    pred:evidence "PRIOR ART WORTH COPYING (Opus repo scan, 2026-08-13): Imbad0202/academic-research-skills (42.4k stars, CC-BY-NC-4.0) implements three-layer citation anchors — quote plus page plus section — and a claim-faithfulness audit checking whether a cited source ACTUALLY SUPPORTS the claim drawn from it, with citation EXISTENCE verified deterministically against Semantic Scholar, OpenAlex, Crossref and arXiv. The split matters for tiering: existence-checking is deterministic and therefore script tier, while faithfulness is judgement and stays agent tier. It is the closest external match to kb:thesis found in the scan. LICENCE: CC-BY-NC, so the design transfers and the code must not be vendored into a commercial product." .

