kb:conflict-detection
    pred:evidence "semantica-agi/semantica (6.5k stars, MIT) is the closest architectural neighbour found in the 2026-08-13 scan and belongs in reckons-competitive.ttl. Its pipeline is Sources, Ingest, Parse, Normalize, Split, Extract, Conflict Detection, Deduplication, Knowledge Graph, with W3C PROV-O provenance, SHACL validation, and both RDF and LPG backends (Oxigraph, Jena, RDF4J; Neo4j, FalkorDB, AGE, Neptune). Two things it has that this roadmap does not: conflict detection positioned BEFORE facts enter the graph, and bi-temporal facts with point-in-time snapshots — zero roadmap mentions of bi-temporal. Worth reading before F122 and F123 land, since it solves the same ingest-ladder problem." .

